		(property "Description" "88% typical efficiency at 600 mA load (VIN = 24 V, VOUT = 5 V)  91% typical efficiency at 600 mA load (VIN = 12 V, VOUT = 5 V)  3.3 V to 36 V input operating voltage range  Up to 1 A output current capability  110 uA input quiescent current  1 MHz fixed switching frequency  Synchronous rectification  Internal compensation network  Peak current mode control  Two different versions: LCM for high efficiency at light loads and LNM for noise-sensitive applications  Output overvoltage protect"
